  "_open_questions": [
    "Q: Where do the actual Nightlord (Day 3 final boss) arenas live? Not in m47/m48/m49 (those are Night Boss arenas). Probably a different prefix not yet surveyed.",
    "Q: Forsaken Hollows DLC expanded the NB pools? Per Fextralife, post-DLC Bell Bearing Hunter is listed as 'Night Boss for Tricephalos AND Night Aspect' — so BBH was added to Night Aspect's pool post-DLC. Other DLC-era additions not captured by the May 2025 PC Gamer article.",
    "Q: Is m49_30 (Royal Revenant) used in any expedition? Same question for m49_90 (Ulcerated Tree Spirit).",
    "Q: For Dark Souls overlay bosses (Dancer, Nameless King, Smelter, Freja, Gaping Dragon, Centipede Demon) — which of the 22 MSB arenas hosts each as its script-overlay? This affects rando placement at those MSBs since the script-spawned boss appears 'on top of' MSB placeholder entities."
